SYNTHETIC / TEST DATA

This directory contains hand-crafted JSONL fixtures used only by the
backtest integration test. The data is NOT real historical market data.

The bundled sample is wired into config/backtest.toml with
is_synthetic_data = true, and the OOS verdict function forces
OosVerdict::SyntheticData whenever this flag is set. The bundled
sample MUST NEVER be presented as evidence that the real strategy
is profitable.

To run the backtest against real data, copy the sample to a new
file, set is_synthetic_data = false in the new backtest config, and
ensure every record passes the strict PIT validation in
src/backtest/data.rs (signal_timestamp, wallet updated_at, market/
safety/costs observed_at all consistent).
